            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Provided is a secondary battery having improved impact resistance. The secondary battery includes a battery case comprising an electrode assembly and an accommodation part configured to accommodate an electrolyte, and the electrode assembly and the electrolyte, which are accommodated in the accommodation part, wherein the secondary battery satisfies following Equation (1): W/S≤42 where, in Equation (1), W is an amount of electrolyte per unit capacity of the secondary battery [unit: g/Ah], and S is a product of a total length [unit: m] and a full width [unit: m] of the electrode assembly.</p>
            </abstract>
